        <mxCell id="5YpDsxbOqPLwtuSWBOvg-34" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(237, 237, 237), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;Highest Title&amp;gt; &amp;lt;Amtgard Name&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(237, 237, 237), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;From &amp;lt;Land&amp;gt; in &amp;lt;Kingdom&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(237, 237, 237), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About: &lt;/b&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Etiam scelerisque nisl libero, eget cursus dolor tempus at. Integer congue, leo vel lobortis rhoncus, magna neque feugiat sapien, quis viverra est magna at nibh. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam imperdiet sapien nisl, ultrices consequat lacus dictum eget. Pellentesque molestie aliquet faucibus. In fringilla ex tincidunt, tempor libero vitae, convallis odio. Suspendisse ullamcorper diam neque, sit amet dictum metus ultricies vitae. Pellentesque tristique, diam ac dignissim eleifend, nisl elit iaculis mauris, id placerat erat est sed mauris. Sed ac urna purus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
